_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIdZc0JHdkfa6PRYCe1KSdfYRSbbWmdMzZEj4xvV0T-Zg&oe=6AA2C552"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "IVA Communication Trainer", "keywords": ["gespreksimulatie", "training", "softskills", "communicatie"], "long_description": "**Train your conversation skills in VR with AI-driven characters.**\n\nIVA places you in a realistic VR environment where you practice face-to-face with lifelike characters. They listen, respond and adapt to what you say \u2014 like a real conversation, but in a safe practice space.\n\n**How does it work?**\n\nPick a scenario that fits your study or work and step into the virtual consulting room. Thanks to AI, every conversation feels different \u2014 your partner reacts naturally to your approach. Afterwards, you get personal feedback: what went well, what can improve, and tips per learning goal. Repeat as often as you like and grow step by step.\n\n**Who is IVA for?**\n\nIVA is developed for students and professionals in healthcare, social work and education. From intake and lifestyle talks to job interviews \u2014 IVA offers a safe place to practice. Whether you're developing soft skills or sharpening your conversation skills: in VR you practice as if it's real.\n\n**What does IVA offer?**\n\n- Lifelike AI characters with natural speech, expression and body language\n- Immersive VR environments from real practice\n- Scenarios for healthcare, welfare and education\n- Personal feedback with scores and tips per learning goal\n- Practice at your own pace\n- Developed with professionals from the field.\n\n**Access**\n\nIVA is available through a licence from your educational institution or organisation. Contact your teacher, trainer or manager for access.\n\nDeveloped by The Simulation Crew \u2014 experts in AI-driven communication training and VR simulation.", "short_description": "Train communication skills through realistic AI-supported roleplays with personalized feedback."}]}, "developer_nam